  16                       BUFR=   0060                    /BUFFER POINTER [LAST LOCATION OF TEXT]
  17                       FRST=   3206                    /FIRST [PERMANENT] TEXT LINE HERE
  18                       LASTV=  0031                    /TOP OF VARIABLES POINTER [FOR TEXT]
  19                       SPARROW=" -200^100+37           /<SP><LEFT-ARROW> OUTPUT FOR CERTAIN TERMINALS
  20               
  21               /       ASSEMBLY INSTRUCTIONS.
  22               
  23               /       MUST BE ASSEMBLED WITHOUT /J (PAL8 /F) SET (TEXT CAN GENERATE 0000 FILL WORD).
