  48               /       WORD [1]        BITS[0-4] GROUP NUMBER, BITS[5-11] RELATIVE LINE NUMBER.
  49               
  50               /       WORD [2-LAST]   STATEMENT TEXT.  CHARACTERS ARE STORED IN SIXBIT BYTE FORMAT
  51               /                       PACKED TWO PER 12-BIT WORD; LINE IS TERMINATED BY <CR> STORED
  52               /                       AS 7715.  NOTE: CONTROL CHARACTERS ARE STORED AS 77XX WHERE XX
  53               /                       IS THE CONTROL CHARACTER CODE; ? (CODE 77) IS NOT ALLOWED.
